1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,910
Why does the world use
dollars? It's not just America.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,271
Deep markets make dollars easier
to trade and hold.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,166
As more people accept them,
more connections become possible.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,875
The dollar leads.
But it's not the only global currency.
